================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS (FACE RECOGNITION, OPTIONAL MODELS)
================================================================================

Face recognition and optional model downloads use third-party libraries and
weights. Using them is subject to the licenses below in addition to the
Business Source License terms for the Prowser application itself.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dlib (face detection and embeddings)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Swift build may statically link dlib (ProwserDlibBridge) when
Vendor/dlib-install is built via swift/Scripts/build_dlib_macos.sh (default
dlib version: 19.24.6). The Python build may use dlib through the optional
face_recognition package.

Source: https://github.com/davisking/dlib
Website: http://dlib.net/

License: Boost Software License 1.0
Original license text: https://github.com/davisking/dlib/blob/master/dlib/LICENSE.txt

