--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dlib face recognition model weights (optional download / Python package)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Models:
  - shape_predictor_5_face_landmarks.dat
  - dlib_face_recognition_resnet_model_v1.dat

The Swift build downloads these as dlib_face_models.zip on first use (person
search, cache faces, Settings → Face Recognition). The Python build installs
the same files via the face_recognition_models package.

Source: https://github.com/ageitgey/face_recognition_models

License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)
Original license text: https://github.com/ageitgey/face_recognition_models/blob/master/LICENSE
Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The person who associated a work with this deed has dedicated the work to the
public domain by waiving all of his or her rights to the work worldwide under
copyright law, including all related and neighboring rights, to the extent
allowed by law.

You can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work, even for commercial
purposes, all without asking permission. See the CC0 legal code for full
terms. Credit: Davis King (dlib) and Adam Geitgey (face_recognition ecosystem).

================================================================================
OPTIONAL DOWNLOADABLE SEARCH MODELS (Core ML)
================================================================================

The Swift build may download optional Core ML packages for similar-image search
(⌘K) and text search (⌘F). Those packages are converted from third-party
weights. Downloading or using them is subject to the licenses below in addition
to the Business Source License terms for the Prowser application itself.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OpenAI CLIP (ViT-B/32 and ViT-L/14)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Models (Hugging Face):
  - openai/clip-vit-base-patch32
  - openai/clip-vit-large-patch14

Includes image tower, text tower, and CLIP BPE tokenizer files (vocab.json,
merges.txt) as distributed on Hugging Face for those repositories.

Source: https://github.com/openai/CLIP
Model cards: https://huggingface.co/openai/clip-vit-base-patch32
             https://huggingface.co/openai/clip-vit-large-patch14

License: MIT License
Original license text: https://github.com/openai/CLIP/blob/main/LICENSE

Copyright (c) 2021 OpenAI

