--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PyTorch torchvision ResNet (ImageNet-1K pretrained)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Models: ResNet-18, ResNet-50, and ResNet-101 backbones with default ImageNet-1K
pretrained weights (exported as Core ML feature extractors).

Source: https://github.com/pytorch/vision
Weights documentation: https://pytorch.org/vision/stable/models.html

License: BSD 3-Clause License (torchvision)
